    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0WELCOME TO SKYFIRE LEGENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/80be9bbba3c0e02690f806d1e4020a2c.poster.avif?t=1746648198\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/80be9bbba3c0e02690f806d1e4020a2c.apng?t=1746648198\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade thrills, speedrunning madness, and maybe even a hole in your desk \u2014 welcome to <i>Skyfire Legends</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your fighter and battle your way through four action-packed levels, each ending with an epic boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: one mistake and it\u2019s back to the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the gauntlet and your fastest run will be saved and ranked against players from around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into each character\u2019s story, unlock every achievement, and discover what it really means to master the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because in <i>Skyfire Legends</i>, <strong>100% completion isn't just an option \u2014 it's the only way to play!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/005741ad6468d6cd9944c4e2c21922d1.avif?t=1746648198\" width=128 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/6a2cd9af9a13f0c421f085984d374534.avif?t=1746648198\" width=128 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/386d3eb6b48cee913c197c6398c32961.avif?t=1746648198\" width=128 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/7c29cc0082c7664e086aa72a6dd98b63.avif?t=1746648198\" width=128 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0WELCOME TO SKYFIRE LEGENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/80be9bbba3c0e02690f806d1e4020a2c.poster.avif?t=1746648198\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/80be9bbba3c0e02690f806d1e4020a2c.apng?t=1746648198\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade thrills, speedrunning madness, and maybe even a hole in your desk \u2014 welcome to <i>Skyfire Legends</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your fighter and battle your way through four action-packed levels, each ending with an epic boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: one mistake and it\u2019s back to the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the gauntlet and your fastest run will be saved and ranked against players from around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into each character\u2019s story, unlock every achievement, and discover what it really means to master the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because in <i>Skyfire Legends</i>, <strong>100% completion isn't just an option \u2014 it's the only way to play!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/005741ad6468d6cd9944c4e2c21922d1.avif?t=1746648198\" width=128 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/6a2cd9af9a13f0c421f085984d374534.avif?t=1746648198\" width=128 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/386d3eb6b48cee913c197c6398c32961.avif?t=1746648198\" width=128 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703790/extras/7c29cc0082c7664e086aa72a6dd98b63.avif?t=1746648198\" width=128 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
